00:10:23.889 --> 00:10:27.026 align:start size:97% position:3%
And so they are in harm's
way and they could get killed

00:10:27.026 --> 00:10:28.327
thereby drawing us
in even further.

00:10:28.327 --> 00:10:31.097 align:start size:88% position:13%
So we are very involved
in this war, Dave,

00:10:31.097 --> 00:10:32.898
and we are getting more
involved by the day.

00:10:32.898 --> 00:10:35.134
- It's interesting 'cause
we call it "this war,"

00:10:35.134 --> 00:10:37.236
