actually are at war right now?

00:10:46.545 --> 00:10:48.948
What do you think the average
Americans should feel like?

00:10:48.948 --> 00:10:51.217 align:start size:88% position:13%
I mean we're
funding it seemingly
endlessly, as you said,

00:10:51.217 --> 00:10:54.053
weapons and and training
and a whole bunch more.

00:10:54.053 --> 00:10:55.488 align:start size:81% position:19%
I mean, do you
think, in essence,

00:10:55.488 --> 00:10:57.456
