co-belligerent in this war

00:11:02.294 --> 00:11:04.664 align:start size:81% position:19%
in the sense that,
like you said,

00:11:04.664 --> 00:11:06.165
we're providing the weapons,

00:11:06.165 --> 00:11:08.134
we're training the Ukrainians
on how to use those weapons,

00:11:08.134 --> 00:11:09.368
including on American soil.

00:11:09.368 --> 00:11:11.871
We are providing
the intelligence,

00:11:11.871 --> 00:11:13.105
we're providing
the battle plans,

00:11:13.105 --> 00:11:15.041
we are doing everything

00:11:15.041 --> 00:11:17.943 align:start position:0%
except for pulling the triggers
and taking the bullets.

00:11:17.943 --> 00:11:19.478
Which, and I don't
wanna minimize that

00:11:19.478 --> 00:11:21.247
because the Ukrainians are
suffering a lot of losses,

00:11:21.247 --> 00:11:23.949
but we are this close
to basically being
directly involved.

00:11:23.949 --> 00:11:28.320
And now you have members
of the security state or

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:32.158
former members like Petraeus,
like Pinetta, like Kinzinger

00:11:32.158 --> 00:11:37.063
saying that if there
is a nuclear use by
Russia in Ukraine,

00:11:37.063 --> 00:11:40.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
