00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:21.907
We simply don't.

00:12:21.907 --> 00:12:23.442
That, by the way,

00:12:23.442 --> 00:12:24.944
and Biden realized this at
the beginning of the war,

00:12:24.944 --> 00:12:27.680
this is why he said we will
not get directly involved.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:28.914
It's 'cause he realized that

00:12:28.914 --> 00:12:31.150
America did not have a
vital national interest.

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.918 align:start size:84% position:16%
But we, through
