the American, well, sorry,

00:13:15.227 --> 00:13:17.196
you had the American
taxpayer on one end,

00:13:17.196 --> 00:13:18.764
on the other end was basically

00:13:18.764 --> 00:13:20.166
the military industrial complex.

00:13:20.166 --> 00:13:22.101
And in between was
