finally was ended.

00:13:42.121 --> 00:13:44.123
After 20 years of us

00:13:44.123 --> 00:13:46.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
not even knowing what
we're doing there anymore,

00:13:46.826 --> 00:13:49.228
I guess we're on some crazy
